{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"convenience privacy tradeoff convenience privacy tradeoff","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","fileName":"Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-17 09:48\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior","Consumer Privacy Paradox","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"convenience privacy tradeoff convenience privacy tradeoff","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","fileName":"Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff","heading":"Convenience-Privacy Tradeoff","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The convenience-privacy tradeoff occurs when a mobile service reduces effort or provides faster information in exchange for access to personal data. Location-aware results and personalized services can make disclosure feel immediately worthwhile.\n\nThe tradeoff is difficult to evaluate because convenience is present and visible while privacy costs may be delayed, uncertain, or distributed across future uses. This asymmetry contributes to the [[Consumer Privacy Paradox]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior","Consumer Privacy Paradox","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Conve